      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Raposa. Vulpix de Alola vive em grupos, cujos integrantes ajudam uns aos outros. Antes de comer suas presas, congela-as por completo com seu hálito de -50 °C. Em dias quentes, cria fragmentos de gelo com suas seis caudas e os espalha ao redor para se refrescar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 25% M / 75% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Vulpix de Alola pode evoluir para Ninetales de Alola no nível 6 ou superior com a ajuda de uma Ice Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Powder Snow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Disable, Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes, Roar</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Confuse Ray, Ice Shard, Spite</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Icy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Payback</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Mist</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Feint Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Hex</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aurora Beam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Extrasensory</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Ice Beam, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Blizzard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Aurora Veil, Captivate, Freeze-Dry, Grudge, Sheer Cold</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Agility, Aqua Tail, Attract, Aurora Veil, Baby-Doll Eyes, Baton Pass, Blizzard, Body Slam, Charm, Chilling Water, Confide, Confuse Ray, Covet, Dark Pulse, Dazzling Gleam, Dig, Disarming Voice, Double Team, Double- Edge, Draining Kiss, Encore, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Foul Play, Frost Breath, Frustration, Hail, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hex, Hidden Power, Ice Beam, Ice Fang, Icicle Spear, Icy Wind, Imprison, Iron Tail, Misty Terrain, Nasty Plot, Pain Split, Payback, Play Rough, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Roar, Role Play, Round, Safeguard, Sleep Talk, Snore, Snowscape, Spite, Stored Power, Substitute, Swagger, Swift, Tail Slap, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Weather Ball, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Agility, Baby-Doll Eyes, Charm, Disable, Encore, Extrasensory, Flail, Freeze-Dry, Howl, Hypnosis, Moonblast, Power Swap, Roar, Secret Power, Spite, Tail Slap</p>",
